{
  "job_B23.3.2.3_20251003_114605": {
    "chunk_text": "Gif mann bi\u00f0 akenned on anre nihte ealne monan, se bi\u00f0 lang lifes & welig. Gyf he bi\u00f0 on tweigra nihta akenned, se bi\u00f0 a seoc & unhal. Gif he bi\u00f0 on \u00fereora nihta, se leofa\u00f0 lange. Gif he bi\u00f0 on IIII nihta akenned, se bi\u00f0 a in wordum. Gif he bi\u00f0 on V nihta adl on geogo\u00f0e gewite\u00f0. Gif he bi\u00f0 on VI nihta adlig se bi\u00f0 lang lifes & ges\u00e6lig. Gif he bi\u00f0 on VII nihta, se bi\u00f0 a weor\u00f0 & lyfa\u00f0 lange. Gif he bi\u00f0 on VIII nihta eald, se swelte\u00f0 sona. Gif he bi\u00f0 on IX nihta, se bi\u00f0 frecenlice akenned. Gif he bi\u00f0 on X nihta, se bi\u00f0 \u00ferowere. Gif he bi\u00f0 on XI nihta, se bi\u00f0 landes ofergenga. Gif he bi\u00f0 on XII nihta eald, se bi\u00f0 on eallum \u00feingum wur\u00f0full. Gif he bi\u00f0 on XIII o\u00f0\u00f0e on XIIII nihta, se bi\u00f0 \u00e6ww\u00e6st & rihtwis. Gif he bi\u00f0 on XV nihta, se bi\u00f0 sona gefaren. Gif he bi\u00f0 on XVI nihta, se bi\u00f0 on eallum \u00feingum nytwur\u00f0e. Gif he bi\u00f0 on XVII nihta, se bi\u00f0 sona gewitan. Gif hif he on XVIII nihta o\u00f0\u00f0e on XIX, se bi\u00f0 ges\u00e6lig. Gif he bi\u00f0 on XX nihta, se bi\u00f0 sona gefaren. Gif he bi\u00f0 on XXI nihta, so bi\u00f0 on godre weor\u00feunge. Gif he bi\u00f0 on XXII nihta, se bi\u00f0 unearh fihtling. Gif he bi\u00f0 on XXIII nihta, se bi\u00f0 \u00feeofscea\u00f0a. Gif he bi\u00f0 on XXIIII nihta",
